 is it important?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe MetaPortal 1.8 features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, which ensures high-resolution visuals and fine detail suitable for immersive mixed reality environments. A smaller pixel pitch provides sharper images, essential for close-viewing AR/VR applications.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the 15360Hz refresh rate enhance the user experience?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate effectively eliminates motion blur, which is crucial for seamless AR/VR pass-through visualizations and reduces eye strain during extended use. This results in smooth and realistic mixed reality experiences.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat types of sensors are integrated into the MetaPortal 1.8?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eMetaPortal 1.8 comes equipped with depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras, enabling gesture-based interactions with virtual objects. These sensors facilitate natural, intuitive user engagement within metaverse portals and mixed reality setups.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs the MetaPortal 1.8 compatible with popular metaverse platforms?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, it supports WebXR and OpenXR protocols, allowing seamless integration with major metaverse platforms and applications, ensuring versatility and future-proofing for evolving virtual experiences.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"MetaPortal 1.8 - Ultra Fine Pixel Pitch LED Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Get ultra-fine pixel pitch with MetaPortal 1.8 LED display in Dubai. Perfect for crisp visuals. Co