LED gateway for metaverse experiences.</strong></p><p>LED display portal designed for bridging physical and metaverse environments. Ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate eliminates motion blur for AR/VR pass-through applications. Built-in depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras enable gesture-based interaction with virtual objects. Supports WebXR, OpenXR, and major metaverse platforms.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of MetaPortal 1.8 and why is it important?</h3><p>The MetaPortal 1.8 features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, which ensures high-resolution visuals and fine detail suitable for immersive mixed reality environments. A smaller pixel pitch provides sharper images, essential for close-viewing AR/VR applications.</p><h3>How does the 15360Hz refresh rate enhance the user experience?</h3><p>The ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate effectively eliminates motion blur, which is crucial for seamless AR/VR pass-through visualizations and reduces eye strain during extended use. This results in smooth and realistic mixed reality experiences.</p><h3>What types of sensors are integrated into the MetaPortal 1.8?</h3><p>MetaPortal 1.8 comes equipped with depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras, enabling gesture-based interactions with virtual objects. These sensors facilitate natural, intuitive user engagement within metaverse portals and mixed reality setups.</p><h3>Is the MetaPortal 1.8 compatible with popular metaverse platforms?</h3><p>Yes, it supports WebXR and OpenXR protocols, allowing seamless integration with major metaverse platforms and applications, ensuring versatility and future-proofing for evolving virtual experiences.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"MetaPortal 1.8 - Ultra Fine Pixel Pitch LED Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\"