latforms?</h3><p>Yes, it supports WebXR and OpenXR protocols, allowing seamless integration with major metaverse platforms and applications, ensuring versatility and future-proofing for evolving virtual experiences.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"MetaPortal 1.8 - Ultra Fine Pixel Pitch LED Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Get ultra-fine pixel pitch with MetaPortal 1.8 LED display in Dubai. Perfect for crisp visuals. Contact Brightluxx for UAE LED display solutions.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/metaportal-18\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T5c8,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"MetaPortal 1.8\", \"description\": \"LED display portal designed for bridging physical and metaverse environments. Ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate eliminates motion blur for AR/VR pass-through applications. Built-in depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras enable gesture-based interaction with virtual objects. Supports WebXR, OpenXR, and major metaverse platforms.\", \"sku\": \"BL-ART-MP18\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/metaportal-18\", \"category\": \"art-immersive\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_metaportal-18.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.o