swer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports WebXR and OpenXR protocols, allowing seamless integration with major metaverse platforms and applications, ensuring versatility and future-proofing for evolving virtual experiences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard manufacturer warranty covering the MetaPortal 1.8, including parts and labor for hardware defects. Extended warranty and on-site support packages can be customized based on project scale and client requirements.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does MetaPortal 1.8 compare to traditional LED displays for mixed reality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional LED displays, MetaPortal 1.8 is specifically engineered for mixed reality with ultra-high refresh rates and integrated sensors. This combination delivers unmatched motion clarity and interactive capabilities critical for metaverse gateways.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are typical installation requirements for the MetaPortal 1.8?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation requires a stable mounting framework suitable for the display size and environment. Brightluxx provides consultation and installation services to ensure optimal placement and integration with existing AR/VR infrastructure.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which environments are ideal for deploying the MetaPortal 1.8?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MetaPortal 1.8 excels in environments requiring immersive user interaction such as metaverse portals, mixed reality experiences, and gaming arenas, where high resolution, low latency, and advanced sensors enhance engagement.\"}}]}a:X\nf:X\nf:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"child