\\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T73a,<h1>MetaPortal 1.8</h1><p>Get ultra-fine pixel pitch with MetaPortal 1.8 LED display in Dubai. Perfect for crisp visuals. Contact Brightluxx for UAE LED display solutions.</p><p><strong>Mixed reality LED gateway for metaverse experiences.</strong></p><p>LED display portal designed for bridging physical and metaverse environments. Ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate eliminates motion blur for AR/VR pass-through applications. Built-in depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras enable gesture-based interaction with virtual objects. Supports WebXR, OpenXR, and major metaverse platforms.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of MetaPortal 1.8 and why is it important?</h3><p>The MetaPortal 1.8 features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, which ensures high-resolution visuals and fine detail suitable for immersive mixed reality environments. A smaller pixel pitch provides sharper images, essential for close-viewing AR/VR applications.</p><h3>How does the 15360Hz refresh rate enhance the user experience?</h3><p>The ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate effectively eliminates motion blur, which is crucial for seamless AR/VR pass-through visualizations and reduces eye strain during extended use. This results in smooth and realistic mixed reality experiences.</p><h3>What types of sensors are integrated into the MetaPortal 1.8?</h3><p>MetaPortal 1.8 comes equipped with depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras, enabling gesture-based interactions with virtual objects. These sensors facilitate natural, intuitive user engagement within metaverse portals and mixed reality setups.</p><h3>Is the MetaPortal 1.8 compatible with popular metaverse platforms?</h3><p>Yes, it supports WebXR and OpenXR protocols, allowing seamless integration with major metaverse platforms and applications, ensuring versatility and future-proofing for evolving virtual experiences.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"MetaPortal 1.8 - Ultra Fine Pixel Pitch LED Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Get ultra-fine pixel pitch with MetaPortal 1.8 LED display in Dubai. Perfect for crisp visuals. Contact Brightluxx for UAE LED display solutions.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/metaportal-18\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}],\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":\"404 — Page Not Found\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The page you requested does not exist.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/products\",\"children